# Reports on the printer: two items lent (one of them overdue), then the
# item listing, the valuation and the open loans printed.  The print
# jobs are compared with TEST/GOLDEN/PRT/PRN1.PRN, which TEST/T_PRN.SH
# also checks against what reaches the printer port on MS-DOS 3.10.
#@ PRN
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T O
K INS ENTER
T 2
K ENTER TAB
T Jane Smith
K TAB TAB
T 2026-09-20
K TAB
T 2026-10-01
K CTRL-S INS ENTER
T 3
K ENTER TAB
T Bob Jones
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2026-11-01
K CTRL-S
S LENT
K ESC ALT-R
T I
K PGDN STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S LISTED
K ESC ALT-R
T V
K PGDN STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S VALUED
K ESC ALT-R
T L
K PGDN STAB SPACE CTRL-S
S LOANS
K ESC
K F3
T Y
